config CHARGER_U30PRO_SGM41513
 bool "U30 Pro native SGM41513 master charger and OTG regulator"
 depends on ARCH_SPRD && I2C && POWER_SUPPLY && REGULATOR && OF
 help
   Native power_supply and hardware OTG regulator for the detected master
   SGM41513 at 0x1a behind the original U30 Pro ti,bq2560x_chg DT node.
   Keeps existing charging limits and protection settings. Battery FGU and
   temperature policy must be adapted separately before writable limits.

config BATTERY_U30PRO_UMP965X
 bool "U30 Pro native UMP965x calibrated battery measurements"
 depends on ARCH_SPRD && OF && POWER_SUPPLY && NVMEM && IIO
 depends on U30PRO_UMP965X_ADC
 help
   Factory-calibrated voltage/current and NTC temperature through the real
   PMIC FGU and IIO ADCs. Preserves USER areas/counter and measures the
   current ADC internal zero point into its volatile offset registers.
   Coulomb SOC initialization/correction is pending and not exposed yet.
